  "foaf:name": "TWILIGHTED",
  "sdo:name": "TWILIGHTED",
  "sdo:description": "TWILIGHTED is a Horizon Europe Twinning project that seeks to revolutionize deep-sea research, development and innovation (RD&amp;I) in Portugal, ultimately benefiting all of Europe. Collaborating closely with GEOMAR (Germany) and NTNU (Norway), TWILIGHTED aims to transform MARE-Madeira / ARDITI (Madeira, Portugal) into a global hub for deep-sea RD&amp;I. Using innovative, lower-cost and more accessible tools; capitalizing on Madeira&#x27;s proximity to deep waters; and welcoming collaborations from across countries, institutes and sectors, TWILIGHTED will help accelerate our global understanding of the ocean and its essential role in sustaining life on earth.",
